注意：few-shot示例中，墙的Representation.position没有指定，而是使用默认。根据规则，对于普通直线墙实体，除非Design Brief或几何反馈明确要求，否则可以省略Representation.position。\n\n 我们构建的BIM JSON对象将包含以下实体和关系：\n\n 实体：\n  1. IfcProject\n  2. IfcSite\n  3. IfcBuilding\n  4. IfcBuildingStorey\n  5. IfcSpace\n  6. IfcWall (4个)\n  7. IfcOpeningElement (2个，分别对应门和窗)\n  8. IfcDoor\n  9. IfcWindow\n\n 关系：\n  1. IfcRelVoidsElement (2个，分别将门的开口与南墙、窗的开口与北墙关联)\n  2. IfcRelFillsElement (2个，分别将门填充到门的开口、窗填充到窗的开口)\n\n 我们按照few-shot示例中的ID命名规范，但根据当前事实调整。\n\n 开始构建JSON。", "refusal": null, "role": "assistant", "tool_calls": null}}], "created": 1782400618, "id": "dab53383f93f42bdba9fa753ffaf68f3", "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "moderation": null, "object": "chat.completion", "service_tier": null, "stop_reason": "stop", "system_fingerprint": null, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 4013, "completion_tokens_details": "[REDACTED]", "prompt_tokens": 7125, "prompt_tokens_details": "[REDACTED]", "total_tokens": 11138}}, "event": "chat.completion", "sequence": 0}
